  },
  "source_semantics": {
    "line": "Py_ssize_t conversion before arithmetic; steep dr>dc; error tie d>=0; original endpoint assigned explicitly; np.zeros-backed typed memoryview returned via np.asarray.",
    "rectangle": "Missing/both end/extent errors before arithmetic; extent adds before min/max; np.round then astype(int), end-inclusive increment only without extent. Optional shape clipping after normalization. meshgrid defaultxy returns grids with profile container/type facts to capture.",
    "disk": "Unpack center before ellipse call; radius passed twice; no separate squared-radius shortcut.",
    "ellipse": "Build center/radii, rotation%=pi, bbox from cos/sin then ceil/floor.astype(int), optionalclip, shifted center; helper repeats modulo/trig, divides before squares, strictdistances<1, np.nonzero rowmajor; force writable then in-place offsets. Nonzero base layout must be captured, not replaced with claimed ownedC arrays."
  },
